From 4a435834ab886ab5268efbfa48456cb9fad32c93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rdr-port <rdr-port@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:56:27 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 14/47] d3d11: texture dump to PNG (pack keys), upscaled pack
 entries mipmapped

RECOMP_TEXTURES_DUMP / the F2 menu writes every swizzled or DXT texture
once as <HASH>_<w>x<h>.png. A pack entry larger than its guest texture moves
the sampler's LOD clamps by the extra levels, and one with mips is
mipmapped over a guest texture without.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/d3d/host_menu.c     |   4 +
 src/d3d/host_menu.h     |   3 +
 src/d3d/nv2a_pb_d3d11.c | 223 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 225 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

